stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Capturing: relevant edit / Update
    Capturing --> FailedLastGood: invalid or over budget
    Capturing --> Queued: owned snapshot complete
    Queued --> InFlight: submit CPU/GPU work
    Queued --> CancelRequested: superseded
    InFlight --> StaleInFlight: newer request / Undo / deletion
    InFlight --> DeviceFailed: device or allocation failure
    InFlight --> Validating: completion fence
    StaleInFlight --> Retiring: fence completes
    DeviceFailed --> CpuFallback: preserve last good
    Validating --> Discarded: revisions changed
    Validating --> FailedLastGood: quality failed
    Validating --> ReadyToPublish: complete validation pass
    ReadyToPublish --> Discarded: host recheck fails
    ReadyToPublish --> Published: atomic host-thread swap
    Published --> Idle
    FailedLastGood --> Idle
    CpuFallback --> Idle
    Retiring --> Idle
    Discarded --> Idle
